#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/reference/dataframe/generated/maxframe.dataframe.read_odps_table.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.dataframe.read\\_odps\\_table"
msgstr "maxframe.dataframe.read\\_odps\\_table"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:1 of
msgid "Read a MaxCompute (ODPS) table into a DataFrame."
msgstr "将 MaxCompute（ODPS）表读为 DataFrame。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:3 of
msgid ""
"Use ``index_col`` to select index columns. Otherwise the engine generates an"
" index using the configured default strategy."
msgstr "通过 ``index_col`` 选择索引列。不指定时，由引擎按配置的默认策略生成索引。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table of
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:6 of
msgid "Name or object of the table to read."
msgstr "待读取表的名称或 Table 对象。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:8 of
msgid ""
"Partition specification or list of specifications to read. If omitted, read "
"all partitions."
msgstr "要读取的分区表达式或分区表达式列表，省略时读取所有分区。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:11 of
msgid ""
"Columns to read, including partition columns when needed. If omitted, read "
"all data columns except those selected as indexes."
msgstr "要读取的列，必要时可以包含分区列。省略时读取所有数据列，但不包含已选为索引的列。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:14 of
msgid "Columns to use as the index. These cannot also appear in ``columns``."
msgstr "用作索引的列，不能同时出现在 ``columns`` 中。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:16 of
msgid ""
"Connection used to resolve and read the table. If omitted, use the global "
"ODPS connection, then the connection from environment variables."
msgstr "用于查找和读取表的 ODPS 连接。省略时先使用全局 ODPS 连接，再尝试从环境变量中读取连接配置。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:19 of
msgid ""
"Whether to read string values as binary. If None, use the reader's default "
"string handling."
msgstr "是否将字符串值读为二进制。为 None 时，使用读取器默认的字符串处理方式。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:22 of
msgid ""
"Include partition columns when ``columns`` is omitted. Selecting a partition"
" column explicitly also enables partition-column reading."
msgstr "未指定 ``columns`` 时是否包含分区列。显式选择分区列，也会启用分区列读取。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:25 of
msgid ""
"Result dtype backend. Defaults to ``options.dataframe.dtype_backend`` when "
"None. This option is experimental."
msgstr "结果的数据类型后端。为 None 时，使用 ``options.dataframe.dtype_backend``。该选项仍为实验功能。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:28 of
msgid ""
"Index strategy when ``index_col`` is omitted. Defaults to "
"``options.dataframe.default_index_type`` (``'range'`` by default). With DPE,"
" ``'range'`` produces consecutive integers starting at zero; "
"``'incremental'`` produces increasing integers with gaps between chunks; "
"``'chunk_range'`` restarts at zero in each chunk and can produce duplicate "
"index values. These chunk-based strategies do not control MCSQL index "
"generation."
msgstr ""
"未指定 ``index_col`` 时使用的索引策略。默认采用 "
"``options.dataframe.default_index_type``，其默认值为 ``'range'``。在 DPE "
"中，``'range'`` 生成从 0 开始的连续整数；``'incremental'`` 生成递增整数，但不同 Chunk "
"之间存在间隔；``'chunk_range'`` 在每个 Chunk 中从 0 重新计数，因此可能出现重复索引。这些基于 Chunk 的策略不控制 "
"MCSQL 的索引生成。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:36 of
msgid ""
"Filter passed to the reader. A string is a SQL WHERE expression. In the "
"nested-list form, conditions in each inner list are ANDed; the outer lists "
"are ORed. For example, ``[[('col1', '==', 'value'), ('col2', '>', 10)]]``. "
"Supported operators are ``==``, ``!=``, ``<``, ``>``, ``<=``, ``>=``, "
"``in``, and ``not in``. Complete filtering is not guaranteed."
msgstr ""
"传给读取器的过滤条件。字符串形式为 SQL WHERE 表达式；嵌套列表中，内层各条件按 AND 组合，外层各列表按 OR 组合，例如 ``[[ "
"('col1', '==', 'value'), ('col2', '>', 10) ]]``。支持 "
"``==``、``!=``、``<``、``>``、``<=``、``>=``、``in`` 和 ``not in``。该参数不保证完成所有过滤。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:43 of
msgid "Additional read options. Common options are listed below."
msgstr "其他读取选项，常用选项列在下方。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:45 of
msgid ""
"Target source bytes per input split, passed through ``**kw``. DPE uses it "
"for non-transactional tables when ``nrows`` is omitted; the default is 64 "
"MiB. MCSQL converts an explicit value to MiB with ``max(1, chunk_bytes // "
"1024**2)`` and sets the SQL ``split_size`` hint. SPE ignores this setting."
msgstr ""
"每个输入分片期望读取的源数据字节数，通过 ``**kw`` 传入。DPE 在非事务表、且未设置 ``nrows`` 时使用，默认值为 64 "
"MiB。MCSQL 将显式值按 ``max(1, chunk_bytes // 1024**2)`` 换算为 MiB，写入 SQL 的 "
"``split_size`` hint。SPE 忽略此设置。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:51 of
msgid ""
"Target rows per DPE input chunk for transactional tables or reads with "
"``nrows``. Passed through ``**kw``. Defaults to ``options.chunk_size`` when "
"configured, otherwise 1024 rows. MCSQL and SPE ignore this setting."
msgstr ""
"事务表或设置了 ``nrows`` 时，DPE 每个输入 Chunk 的目标行数，通过 ``**kw`` 传入。配置了 "
"``options.chunk_size`` 时使用该值，否则默认 1024 行。MCSQL 和 SPE 忽略此设置。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:55 of
msgid ""
"Maximum rows to read, passed through ``**kw``. If omitted, no row limit is "
"requested."
msgstr "最多读取的行数，通过 ``**kw`` 传入。省略时不设置行数上限。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table of
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:59 of
msgid "Lazy DataFrame representing the selected table data."
msgstr "表示所选表数据的惰性 DataFrame。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table of
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "返回类型"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table of
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "异常"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:62 of
msgid ""
"If no ODPS connection is available or a requested column is missing.     "
"Also raised for partition options on a non-partitioned table,     "
"overlapping index and data columns, or an invalid index strategy or     "
"dtype backend."
msgstr "没有可用的 ODPS 连接，或请求的列不存在。对非分区表指定分区参数、索引列与数据列重叠、索引策略或 dtype 后端无效时，也会抛出此异常。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:63 of
msgid ""
"If PyODPS cannot construct a connection from incomplete environment     "
"credentials. Pass an initialized ODPS object with ``odps_entry`` to     "
"avoid environment-based connection discovery."
msgstr ""
"环境变量中的凭证不完整，导致 PyODPS 无法创建连接。可以通过 ``odps_entry`` 显式传入已初始化的 ODPS "
"对象，避免从环境变量中查找连接。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:64 of
msgid "If the table cannot be found or resolved through the configured catalog."
msgstr "找不到表，且无法通过配置的目录解析该表时抛出。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:68 of
msgid ":py:obj:`DataFrame.to_odps_table`"
msgstr ":py:obj:`DataFrame.to_odps_table`"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:69 of
msgid "Write a DataFrame to a MaxCompute table."
msgstr "将 DataFrame 写入 MaxCompute 表。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:72 of
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:73 of
msgid ""
"For input partition sizes, see :ref:`udf_source_chunk_settings`. For task "
"memory and CPU sizing, see :ref:`udf_tuning_resources`."
msgstr ""
"输入分片大小的设置见 :ref:`udf_source_chunk_settings`，任务内存和 CPU 的选值方法见 "
":ref:`udf_tuning_resources`。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:77 of
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:78 of
msgid ""
"These examples require a MaxCompute connection and existing tables with the "
"columns and partitions shown. Set the connection environment variables "
"before running them. Reading creates a lazy expression; execution is "
"separate."
msgstr "这些示例需要 MaxCompute 连接，以及包含示例列和分区的已有表。运行前先设置连接环境变量。读表操作只构建惰性表达式，执行需要单独发起。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:93 of
msgid "Read a table with a target source split size of 32 MiB."
msgstr "读取表，将源数据分片的目标大小设为 32 MiB。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:104 of
msgid "Limit the read to 10,000 rows and request 1,000-row DPE input chunks."
msgstr "最多读取 10,000 行，并将 DPE 输入 Chunk 的目标行数设为 1,000。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:110 of
msgid "Select partitions, data columns, and an index column."
msgstr "选择分区、数据列和索引列。"

#: maxframe.dataframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:118 of
msgid ""
"Pass a SQL filter expression, or the equivalent nested-list form. Complete "
"filtering is not guaranteed."
msgstr "传入 SQL 过滤表达式，或等价的嵌套列表。该参数不保证完成所有过滤。"
